<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45286" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stătŭārĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to statues</i>
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ars,</span>”
				<i>the art of making statues</i>, <i>statuary</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					34, 7, 16, § 33</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">36, 5, 4,
				§ 37</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">temperatura (aeris),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					34, 9, 20, § 97</span></i>
			.—As <i>substt.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stătŭ-ārĭa</span></b> ,
				ae, f., <i>the art of
				statuary</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 12, 45, § 156</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">36, 5, 4, §
			15</span></i> (= ars fingendi). —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stătŭārĭus</span></b> ,
				ii, m., <i>a maker of
				statues</i>, <i>a statuary</i> (syn. sculptor),
				<i><span class="en">Quint. 2, 21, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep.
				88, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 8, 34, §
		54</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
